        Say "Now you babysitting?Hmm ... I'm passing a [Golden Goblet of a Dragon] for the [Guard] Melburick."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Now you babysitting?Hmm ...Once [Guard] Dear Zalk, of a [Golden Goblet of a Dragon] for I'm passing."
