On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "<selfname> welcome back."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "How did the day went? Will you come looking for the [Golden Goblet of a Dragon]?\n\nBring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Malverick."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Welcome back <selfname>."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "How did the day went? Will you come looking for the [Golden Goblet of a Dragon]?\n\nBring [Dragon Golden Chalice] to Zark."

